# ===== NOTES =====
# 
# CRITICAL - NEVER commit these files:
# 1. google-services.json (Android Firebase config)
# 2. GoogleService-Info.plist (iOS Firebase config)
# 3. firebase_options.dart (Generated Firebase config)
# 4. *.keystore or *.jks (App signing keys)
# 5. local.properties (Local SDK paths)
# 6. Any file containing "secret", "key", "password"
# 7. Thesis documents or research papers with sensitive info
# 8. Large binary files (APKs, IPAs) - use GitHub Releases instead
#
# SAFE to commit:
# - Source code (.dart files)
# - pubspec.yaml and pubspec.lock
# - README.md and essential documentation
# - Asset files (images, fonts) - but be mindful of size
# - Configuration templates (.env.example)
#
# TIP: Before committing, always run:
#   git status
#   git diff
# to verify what you're about to commit
